# The pixel tests natively, SDL3 drawing with GL: haxe build-native.hxml -> native/PixelTests; hxcpp links the SDL3 library
# HELIX_SDL3_LIBRARY names (BUILDING.md). It prints {passed, checks, failures} and exits 1 on a failure.
-lib helix-render
-cp .
-main PixelTests
-dce full
-D HXCPP_COMPILE_THREADS=4
-cpp native
